          "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 14 2024 14:00:31 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">90 degree angles<br>\n </span></span>The coil rotates 90 degrees at each small loop, creating a three-dimensional shape.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Small loop<br>\n </span></span>The small loops add body to the coil and help maintain its shape.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Large loop<br>\n </span></span>The large loops appose the vessel wall, providing stability within the aneurysm.</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 16 2024 16:29:44 GMT+0000",
